{"id":"u09","level":"A1","emoji":"🌦️","title":{"t":"Das Wetter","s":"The weather","a":"audio/de-en/68507221f8eb.mp3"},"goals":["Talk about the weather: Es ist sonnig. Es regnet.","Name the months and the four seasons","Say when: im Juli, im Sommer","Say when your birthday is"],"words":[{"id":"w01","t":"das Wetter","s":"weather","emoji":"⛅","sym":true,"ex":{"t":"Wie ist das Wetter?","s":"What's the weather like?","a":"audio/de-en/94b4941ac169.mp3"},"img":"img/e/26c5.svg","a":"audio/de-en/41d42d5c6fbe.mp3"},{"id":"w02","t":"die Sonne","pl":"die Sonnen","s":"sun","emoji":"☀️","ex":{"t":"Die Sonne scheint.","s":"The sun is shining.","a":"audio/de-en/26cc903987ec.mp3"},"img":"img/e/2600.svg","a":"audio/de-en/0492c2aefefe.mp3","pla":"audio/de-en/5674da876a6f.mp3"},{"id":"w03","t":"der Regen","s":"rain","emoji":"🌧️","ex":{"t":"Ich mag Regen.","s":"I like rain.","a":"audio/de-en/4608bb75c9ed.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f327.svg","a":"audio/de-en/139ac8ae6b65.mp3"},{"id":"w04","t":"der Schnee","s":"snow","emoji":"❄️","ex":{"t":"Im Winter gibt es Schnee.","s":"There is snow in winter.","a":"audio/de-en/1306320f46b8.mp3"},"img":"img/e/2744.svg","a":"audio/de-en/90df4e9ab906.mp3"},{"id":"w05","t":"der Wind","pl":"die Winde","s":"wind","emoji":"🌬️","ex":{"t":"Der Wind ist kalt.","s":"The wind is cold.","a":"audio/de-en/f7208632cb9a.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f32c.svg","a":"audio/de-en/26edf3861eb9.mp3","pla":"audio/de-en/be6c22375b5c.mp3"},{"id":"w06","t":"sonnig","s":"sunny","emoji":"","ex":{"t":"Heute ist es sonnig.","s":"It's sunny today.","a":"audio/de-en/6061f860df17.mp3"},"img":null,"a":"audio/de-en/2600a131ad29.mp3"},{"id":"w07","t":"warm","s":"warm","emoji":"","ex":{"t":"Im Frühling ist es warm.","s":"It's warm in spring.","a":"audio/de-en/704ffc7c9ec2.mp3"},"img":null,"a":"audio/de-en/0219efc9e6aa.mp3"},{"id":"w08","t":"kalt","s":"cold","emoji":"🥶","sym":true,"ex":{"t":"Im Winter ist es kalt.","s":"It's cold in winter.","a":"audio/de-en/2576c53dacba.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f976.svg","a":"audio/de-en/89a74e2918f4.mp3"},{"id":"w09","t":"regnen","s":"to rain","emoji":"","ex":{"t":"Es regnet.","s":"It's raining.","a":"audio/de-en/3ec13f13515b.mp3"},"img":null,"a":"audio/de-en/e3cd112ce9c1.mp3"},{"id":"w10","t":"der Frühling","pl":"die Frühlinge","s":"spring","emoji":"🌷","sym":true,"ex":{"t":"Nouruz ist im Frühling.","s":"Nowruz is in spring.","a":"audio/de-en/e1cd2e816442.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f337.svg","a":"audio/de-en/8e86942fc95e.mp3","pla":"audio/de-en/9f8124dc78d0.mp3"},{"id":"w11","t":"der Sommer","pl":"die Sommer","s":"summer","emoji":"🏖️","sym":true,"ex":{"t":"Im Sommer ist es heiß.","s":"It's hot in summer.","a":"audio/de-en/1705ed051ed7.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f3d6.svg","a":"audio/de-en/eddfb7931398.mp3","pla":"audio/de-en/0ff6aa2ae5f2.mp3"},{"id":"w12","t":"der Herbst","pl":"die Herbste","s":"fall; autumn","emoji":"🍂","sym":true,"ex":{"t":"Im Herbst ist es windig.","s":"It's windy in the fall.","a":"audio/de-en/210e657a7994.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f342.svg","a":"audio/de-en/2a4abd679bc4.mp3","pla":"audio/de-en/31ebcb410012.mp3"},{"id":"w13","t":"der Winter","pl":"die Winter","s":"winter","emoji":"⛄","sym":true,"ex":{"t":"Im Winter schneit es.","s":"It snows in winter.","a":"audio/de-en/9fdee0852026.mp3"},"img":"img/e/26c4.svg","a":"audio/de-en/296535ae5ab4.mp3","pla":"audio/de-en/c8a307395c3e.mp3"},{"id":"w14","t":"der Monat","pl":"die Monate","s":"month","emoji":"📅","sym":true,"ex":{"t":"Ein Jahr hat zwölf Monate.","s":"A year has twelve months.","a":"audio/de-en/4d5b1456fd75.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f4c5.svg","a":"audio/de-en/94974edcfb46.mp3","pla":"audio/de-en/c69805a62cb5.mp3"},{"id":"w15","t":"der Tag","pl":"die Tage","s":"day","emoji":"","ex":{"t":"Die Woche hat sieben Tage.","s":"A week has seven days.","a":"audio/de-en/f2b22f34e26d.mp3"},"img":null,"a":"audio/de-en/62fc9b049e1f.mp3","pla":"audio/de-en/1a2fb4b10b93.mp3"},{"id":"w16","t":"die Nacht","pl":"die Nächte","s":"night","emoji":"🌙","sym":true,"ex":{"t":"In der Nacht ist es kalt.","s":"It's cold at night.","a":"audio/de-en/e6920dacc8cf.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f319.svg","a":"audio/de-en/0aaf74656f7d.mp3","pla":"audio/de-en/7d396492a0cd.mp3"}],"phrases":[{"id":"p01","t":"Wie ist das Wetter heute?","s":"What's the weather like today?","a":"audio/de-en/78fcdb173499.mp3"},{"id":"p02","t":"Es regnet.","s":"It's raining.","a":"audio/de-en/3ec13f13515b.mp3"},{"id":"p03","t":"Es schneit.","s":"It's snowing.","a":"audio/de-en/782948f3679d.mp3"},{"id":"p04","t":"Es ist heiß!","s":"It's hot!","a":"audio/de-en/d866059ceb38.mp3"},{"id":"p05","t":"Es ist zwanzig Grad.","s":"It's twenty degrees.","a":"audio/de-en/ed0869067ed6.mp3"},{"id":"p06","t":"Wann hast du Geburtstag?","s":"When is your birthday?","a":"audio/de-en/c30f90aefc56.mp3"},{"id":"p07","t":"Ich habe im Mai Geburtstag.","s":"My birthday is in May.","alts":["Im Mai habe ich Geburtstag."],"a":"audio/de-en/5ab3a6fe983f.mp3"},{"id":"p08","t":"Frohes neues Jahr!","s":"Happy New Year!","a":"audio/de-en/4e2faab85d07.mp3"}],"dialogue":{"title":{"t":"Wie ist das Wetter in Teheran?","s":"What's the weather like in Tehran?","a":"audio/de-en/1342bd577575.mp3"},"speakers":{"A":{"name":"Anna","voice":"f"},"B":{"name":"Reza","voice":"m"}},"lines":[{"sp":"A","t":"Hallo, Reza! Du bist in Teheran, richtig? Wie ist das Wetter dort?","s":"Hi, Reza! You're in Tehran, right? What's the weather like there?","a":"audio/de-en/81bc23ecebcc.mp3"},{"sp":"B","t":"Hallo, Anna! Ja, richtig. Hier ist es sonnig und warm. Es ist zwanzig Grad.","s":"Hi, Anna! Yes, that's right. Here it's sunny and warm. It's twenty degrees.","a":"audio/de-en/5ef5057e6445.mp3"},{"sp":"A","t":"Toll! In Berlin regnet es. Es ist kalt und windig.","s":"Great! In Berlin it's raining. It's cold and windy.","a":"audio/de-en/6d87d258b233.mp3"},{"sp":"B","t":"Oh nein! Wie kalt ist es?","s":"Oh no! How cold is it?","a":"audio/de-en/5cf86a2811d6.mp3"},{"sp":"A","t":"Es ist fünf Grad.","s":"It's five degrees.","a":"audio/de-en/128fe207b853.mp3"},{"sp":"B","t":"Der Frühling in Teheran ist schön. Und im März ist Nouruz!","s":"Spring in Tehran is beautiful. And in March it's Nowruz!","a":"audio/de-en/1b1f7c731f5e.mp3"},{"sp":"A","t":"Nouruz? Was ist das?","s":"Nowruz? What's that?","a":"audio/de-en/74dcf0d7271d.mp3"},{"sp":"B","t":"Das ist das Neujahrsfest im Iran.","s":"It's the New Year festival in Iran.","a":"audio/de-en/48499b32f61f.mp3"},{"sp":"A","t":"Schön! Dann frohes neues Jahr, Reza!","s":"How nice! Then happy New Year, Reza!","a":"audio/de-en/dfdd8f140a13.mp3"},{"sp":"B","t":"Danke, Anna! Tschüss!","s":"Thanks, Anna! Bye!","a":"audio/de-en/b53830fcc098.mp3"}]},"grammar":[{"id":"g01","title":{"t":"Es regnet. Es ist kalt.","s":"Talking about the weather with es"},"explain":"German weather sentences use **es** (it) – just like in English.\nWith an adjective, use **es ist**: **Es ist sonnig. Es ist kalt. Es ist windig.**\nWith a weather verb, use **es** + verb: **Es regnet** (it's raining), **Es schneit** (it's snowing). German has no -ing form, so **es regnet** means both *it rains* and *it is raining*.\nRemember the verb-second rule: **Heute regnet es. Im Winter ist es kalt.**","table":[["sonnig","Es ist sonnig."],["warm / heiß","Es ist warm. / Es ist heiß."],["kalt","Es ist kalt."],["windig","Es ist windig."],["regnen","Es regnet."],["schneien","Es schneit."]],"examples":[{"t":"Heute ist es sonnig.","s":"It's sunny today.","a":"audio/de-en/6061f860df17.mp3"},{"t":"Es regnet und es ist kalt.","s":"It's raining and it's cold.","a":"audio/de-en/f15a14b65c77.mp3"},{"t":"Im Winter schneit es.","s":"It snows in winter.","a":"audio/de-en/9fdee0852026.mp3"},{"t":"Wie ist das Wetter? – Es ist warm.","s":"What's the weather like? – It's warm.","a":"audio/de-en/f9ca4cbff04f.mp3"},{"t":"Am Tag ist es warm, aber in der Nacht ist es kalt.","s":"It's warm during the day, but it's cold at night.","a":"audio/de-en/48d94c2640f9.mp3"}],"exercises":[{"type":"choice","t":"Es ___ sonnig.","options":["regnet","ist","hat"],"answer":1,"s":"It's sunny.","why":"With an adjective like sonnig, use es ist: Es ist sonnig.","full":"Es ist sonnig.","a":"audio/de-en/d547a3fa114b.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"Heute ___ es.","options":["regnet","ist","regnen"],"answer":0,"s":"It's raining today.","why":"regnen is a verb: es regnet. After Heute the verb comes second.","full":"Heute regnet es.","a":"audio/de-en/8aca9aea5ffb.mp3"},{"type":"type","t":"___ schneit.","answer":["Es"],"s":"It's snowing.","why":"Weather verbs need es as the subject: Es schneit.","full":"Es schneit.","a":"audio/de-en/782948f3679d.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"Im Sommer ist ___ heiß.","options":["er","sie","es"],"answer":2,"s":"It's hot in summer.","why":"Weather sentences always use es (it): es ist heiß.","full":"Im Sommer ist es heiß.","a":"audio/de-en/1705ed051ed7.mp3"},{"type":"type","task":"Start with Im Herbst.","cue":"Es regnet.","t":"Im Herbst ___.","answer":["regnet es"],"s":"It rains in the fall.","why":"After a time at the start, the verb comes second and es follows it: Im Herbst regnet es.","full":"Im Herbst regnet es.","a":"audio/de-en/12b632421e6c.mp3","ca":"audio/de-en/3ec13f13515b.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"Im Winter ___.","options":["es schneit","schneit es","schneien es"],"answer":1,"s":"It snows in winter.","why":"After a time at the start, the verb comes second and es follows: Im Winter schneit es.","full":"Im Winter schneit es.","a":"audio/de-en/9fdee0852026.mp3"},{"type":"order","t":"Heute ist es kalt.","s":"It's cold today.","alts":["Es ist heute kalt."],"full":"Heute ist es kalt.","a":"audio/de-en/171e6dc8f2a2.mp3"},{"type":"choice","task":"Which reply fits?","cue":"Wie ist das Wetter heute?","t":"___","options":["Es ist sonnig und warm.","Es ist im Juli.","Ich habe im Mai Geburtstag."],"answer":0,"s":"It's sunny and warm.","why":"Wie ist das Wetter? asks about the weather. Answer with es ist + adjective or es + a weather verb.","full":"Es ist sonnig und warm.","a":"audio/de-en/f4bd11267256.mp3","ca":"audio/de-en/78fcdb173499.mp3"}]},{"id":"g02","title":{"t":"im Juli, im Sommer","s":"Months, seasons and im"},"explain":"All months and seasons are **masculine**: **der Juli, der Sommer**.\nTo say *in* a month or a season, use **im** (= in dem): **im Juli, im Winter**.\nThe months look a lot like English, so they're easy to learn. Watch the spelling: **März, Mai, Juni, Juli, Oktober, Dezember**.\nBirthdays: **Ich habe im Mai Geburtstag.** (My birthday is in May.)","table":[["der Frühling","März · April · Mai"],["der Sommer","Juni · Juli · August"],["der Herbst","September · Oktober · November"],["der Winter","Dezember · Januar · Februar"]],"examples":[{"t":"Im Juli ist es heiß.","s":"It's hot in July.","a":"audio/de-en/eba38d301e4c.mp3"},{"t":"Im Dezember schneit es.","s":"It snows in December.","a":"audio/de-en/99bc8cccb9dd.mp3"},{"t":"Ich habe im Mai Geburtstag.","s":"My birthday is in May.","a":"audio/de-en/5ab3a6fe983f.mp3"},{"t":"Im Herbst ist es windig.","s":"It's windy in the fall.","a":"audio/de-en/210e657a7994.mp3"}],"exercises":[{"type":"choice","t":"Ich habe ___ Juni Geburtstag.","options":["in der","im","um"],"answer":1,"s":"My birthday is in June.","why":"Months and seasons take im (= in dem): im Juni.","full":"Ich habe im Juni Geburtstag.","a":"audio/de-en/f225e1d413ff.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"Im Frühling: März, April und ___.","options":["Juli","Oktober","Mai"],"answer":2,"s":"In spring: March, April and May.","why":"The spring months are März, April and Mai.","full":"Im Frühling: März, April und Mai.","a":"audio/de-en/3139f9c83e27.mp3"},{"type":"type","t":"Januar, Februar, ___, April","answer":["März","Maerz"],"s":"January, February, March, April","why":"The third month is März, written with ä (or ae).","full":"Januar, Februar, März, April","a":"audio/de-en/ae32f2b37d73.mp3"},{"type":"type","t":"Im Juni, Juli und August ist ___.","answer":["Sommer","der Sommer"],"s":"In June, July and August it's summer.","why":"June, July and August are the summer months: der Sommer.","full":"Im Juni, Juli und August ist Sommer.","a":"audio/de-en/ba158a0df593.mp3"},{"type":"choice","task":"Which reply fits?","cue":"Wann hast du Geburtstag?","t":"___","options":["Im Oktober.","Am Oktober.","Um Oktober."],"answer":0,"s":"In October.","why":"Months take im: im Oktober. Am is for days, um for clock times.","full":"Im Oktober.","a":"audio/de-en/cde4fd3320c9.mp3","ca":"audio/de-en/c30f90aefc56.mp3"},{"type":"type","task":"Start with Im Mai.","cue":"Ich habe im Mai Geburtstag.","t":"Im Mai ___ Geburtstag.","answer":["habe ich"],"s":"My birthday is in May.","why":"The verb stays in position 2, so ich moves behind it: Im Mai habe ich Geburtstag.","full":"Im Mai habe ich Geburtstag.","a":"audio/de-en/add2d8af521b.mp3","ca":"audio/de-en/5ab3a6fe983f.mp3"},{"type":"order","t":"Im Winter ist es kalt.","s":"It's cold in winter.","alts":["Es ist im Winter kalt."],"full":"Im Winter ist es kalt.","a":"audio/de-en/2576c53dacba.mp3"}]}],"reading":{"title":{"t":"Die Jahreszeiten in Deutschland","s":"The seasons in Germany","a":"audio/de-en/ec38c0d64e23.mp3"},"text":[{"t":"In Deutschland gibt es vier Jahreszeiten.","s":"In Germany there are four seasons.","a":"audio/de-en/b5ec1cfe9924.mp3"},{"t":"Im Frühling ist es warm, aber es regnet auch.","s":"In spring it's warm, but it also rains.","a":"audio/de-en/8f76240088ee.mp3"},{"t":"Im Sommer scheint die Sonne. Es ist warm oder heiß.","s":"In summer the sun shines. It's warm or hot.","a":"audio/de-en/fb035fd25f15.mp3"},{"t":"Im Herbst ist es windig und es regnet.","s":"In the fall it's windy and it rains.","a":"audio/de-en/eba99f6ba5eb.mp3"},{"t":"Im Winter ist es kalt und es schneit.","s":"In winter it's cold and it snows.","a":"audio/de-en/5fbc51233d25.mp3"},{"t":"Lukas mag den Sommer.","s":"Lukas likes summer.","a":"audio/de-en/eb8850ce7af8.mp3"},{"t":"Anna mag den Winter. Sie hat im Dezember Geburtstag.","s":"Anna likes winter. Her birthday is in December.","a":"audio/de-en/8c8073442c94.mp3"}],"questions":[{"q":{"t":"Wie viele Jahreszeiten gibt es?","s":"How many seasons are there?","a":"audio/de-en/7fd9de2cee60.mp3"},"options":["drei","vier","zwölf"],"answer":1},{"q":{"t":"Wie ist das Wetter im Herbst?","s":"What's the weather like in the fall?","a":"audio/de-en/d875052c3a16.mp3"},"options":["Es ist heiß.","Es schneit.","Es ist windig und es regnet."],"answer":2},{"q":{"t":"Wann hat Anna Geburtstag?","s":"When is Anna's birthday?","a":"audio/de-en/b5241c4194fa.mp3"},"options":["im Dezember","im Juli","im Mai"],"answer":0},{"q":{"t":"Was mag Lukas?","s":"What does Lukas like?","a":"audio/de-en/d9b80e6e2cce.mp3"},"options":["den Winter","den Sommer","den Regen"],"answer":1},{"q":{"t":"Wie ist das Wetter an Annas Geburtstag?","s":"What's the weather like on Anna's birthday?","a":"audio/de-en/5b88e8ca31f2.mp3"},"options":["Es ist kalt.","Es ist heiß.","Es ist warm."],"answer":0}]},"sentences":[{"t":"Wie ist das Wetter heute?","s":"What's the weather like today?","a":"audio/de-en/78fcdb173499.mp3"},{"t":"Heute ist es sonnig und warm.","s":"Today it's sunny and warm.","alts":["Es ist heute sonnig und warm."],"a":"audio/de-en/66ffc10d94a2.mp3"},{"t":"Im Januar ist es kalt.","s":"It's cold in January.","alts":["Es ist im Januar kalt."],"a":"audio/de-en/0d32b59af155.mp3"},{"t":"Im August ist es heiß.","s":"It's hot in August.","alts":["Es ist im August heiß."],"a":"audio/de-en/9e02cfbd18a5.mp3"},{"t":"Ich habe im April Geburtstag.","s":"My birthday is in April.","alts":["Im April habe ich Geburtstag."],"a":"audio/de-en/59631cd0a25d.mp3"},{"t":"Es ist minus zwei Grad.","s":"It's minus two degrees.","a":"audio/de-en/dd01c75a6afd.mp3"},{"t":"Wir mögen den Frühling.","s":"We like spring.","a":"audio/de-en/e64c90db9649.mp3"},{"t":"Im Herbst regnet es.","s":"It rains in the fall.","alts":["Es regnet im Herbst."],"a":"audio/de-en/12b632421e6c.mp3"}],"img":"img/e/1f326.svg"}